{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JimboClassicalLimit","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Lie.Matrix"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.colourBridge_gl3_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.colourBridge_gl3_one","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourBridge.lean#L66-L75","doc":"**Calibration: the class is satisfiable at `q = 1`**, by `gl₃(K)` with `Φ = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge.q_eq_one_of_e01_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge.q_eq_one_of_e01_mem","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourBridge.lean#L49-L54","doc":"**The crossing field forces `q = 1` once `E₀₁` is in the image.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge.bridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge.bridge","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourBridge.lean#L46-L46","doc":"A faithful Lie action on the tower triplet, compatible with the tower crossing at `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourBridge.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourBridge","kind":"class","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourBridge.lean#L39-L47","doc":"**Conjecture (colour bridge, strengthened).** Over a field `K` (intended: `ℚ(i)`, carrying the\noctonion complex structure `±L_e`), the colour Lie algebra `g` (intended: `su3 e ⊗ ℚ(i)`) maps\ninjectively and bracket-preservingly into `gl₃(K)`, and every image matrix, acting by the primitive\ncoproduct, commutes with Jimbo's crossing `Ř(q, q⁻¹)` on `K³ ⊗ K³`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:sm-colour-stabilizer-action","label":"conj:sm-colour-stabilizer-action","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/sm-colour-stabilizer-action.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}